# --- Secrets and credentials (NEVER commit these) -----------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
service-account*.json
secrets.*
*.secret

# --- Data ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw downloads are never committed: `headroom acquire` retrieves every input
# from its authoritative source (challenge rule) and records cache/manifest.json.
cache/
# data/ holds only small team-created inputs (the eight named mobility hubs) and
# the optional tier-A district table, each a few KB and documented in
# docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md.

# --- Build / output artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Run outputs, except the committed reference results the reproducibility check
# compares against.
out/*
!out/README.md
!out/reference/
# The software bill of materials is exported from GitHub's dependency graph
# (Insights → Dependency graph → Export SBOM); reproduce.yml also builds a
# CycloneDX one as a CI artifact. Neither is committed.
*.bom
sbom.json
sbom.spdx.json

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
/dist/
/build/
*.egg-info/

# --- Local environment / OS ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.log
